abstract: "PromptDC for VS Code is an optional editor extension for PromptDC for Desktop, the universal AI writing assistant and enhancer for macOS and Windows; it rewrites prompts in editor AI chat panels. The Code profile uses one universal editable system prompt and Simple or Structured output. Pro $9/month; Enterprise $15/month; Developer Lifetime from $69 one-time with BYOK; no free plan."
